   "stem_html": "A result of the Native Americans’ susceptibility to European disease was",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1166274,
     "content_html": "the importation of African slaves for labor purposes\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1166273,
     "content_html": "the hostile resistance of Native Americans to Spanish conquest\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1166272,
     "content_html": "the harvesting of high-caloric and diverse food stuffs for the European population\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 1166271,
     "content_html": "the rapid evolution of a capitalist system in Europe\n"
    }
